   3. TestCount:       0: Test Continuously
                       1- Max : Total number of tests that will be executed.
   4. TestIncrement:   Must be less than the number of test count specified.
   5. OnError:         Specifies the action if an error occurs during any
                       given pass.
   6. LoopbackType:    Be sure to select the appropriate HBA connector for
                       testing.  For internal loopback, a loopback connector
                       must be plugged in the HBA connector.
                       This option is applied only for loopback test.
